# Raw Knesset vote-results database — 234MB, regenerable via scripts/knesset_scraper.py.
# Too large for normal git (GitHub blocks pushes >100MB); never meant to be distributed itself —
# only the curated data/*.json files this project derives from it are meant to be public.
data/knesset_votes.sqlite3

# Scratch/output files that don't belong in version history
*.pyc
__pycache__/
